---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"film\"])"
---
Show the film stocks and papers that a Film node of a `--settings` file can use

Usage: ym film [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List the film stocks and papers with their ids, kinds, ISO numbers and matching papers
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
